   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2018-03-21",
   "text": "Protect the Gig Economy Act of 2018\n This bill amends Rule 23 of the Federal Rules of Civil Procedure to expand the preliminary requirements for class certification in a class action lawsuit to include a new requirement that the claim does not allege misclassification of employees as independent contractors."
  }
